633000]],"about":{"what":"Dick's Sporting Goods Inc (DKS). This chart runs from Apr 2, 2024 to Aug 8, 2024.","setup":"The stock rose about 31% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 3 weeks, peaking at $229.56 and pulling back 8% at its deepest. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Jun 20, 2024 it closed at $229.51, its first close above the base high of $228.42. Volume that day was 1.2M shares, 1.24x the prior 10-day average of 934K. It didn't hold. By Jun 27, 2024 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $200.58.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}